  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Death’s approach only makes you harder to kill.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Deathless Master<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When at negative hit points, you gain immunity to ability damage, ability drain, bleed, and death effects, and you also gain a +1 enhancement bonus to natural armor, increasing by 1 for every 5 negative hit points you possess. This natural armor bonus stacks with itself, but not with other enhancement bonuses to natural armor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc68\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
